# Four bridges in a ring; the root's cheaper cable then fails and comes back.
mode rstp
bridge 32768 020000000001 2
bridge 32768 020000000002 2
bridge 32768 020000000003 2
bridge 32768 020000000004 2
link 0 1 1 1
link 1 2 2 1
link 2 2 3 1
link 3 2 0 2
cost 3 1 100
up 0
up 1
up 2
up 3
run 60
dump
down 0
run 90
dump
up 0
run 90
dump
